      "Section": "Instant Reposts",
      "Anchor": "instant-reposts",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The resourceName for reposts events is instantReposts. This captures all reposts (without additional commentary) made by a regulated member. The methods available are CREATE.\nThe content reposts is specified int he repostedContent field within processedActivity.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
